New 2-bedroom apartment with Terrace, Parking and Storage in Pinhal do General - Fernão Ferro

Imagine living in an apartment where comfort, modernity, and tranquillity come together perfectly.

This magnificent 2-bedroom apartment, currently under construction with completion expected in December 2026, has been designed to offer an exceptional quality of life, featuring high-end finishes, cutting-edge technology, and a prime location just minutes from shops, schools, services, green spaces, and major transport links.

Upon entering, you'll find a welcoming entrance hall with a built-in wardrobe, ideal for organisation and storage.

The spacious open-plan living area seamlessly connects to the fully equipped modern kitchen, creating a bright and functional space. Direct access to the generous terrace invites you to enjoy unique outdoor momentswhether for relaxing, entertaining friends, or creating a pleasant leisure area.

The private area includes:

- A bedroom with a built-in wardrobe;

- A full bathroom with a walk-in shower;

- A comfortable en-suite bedroom with a built-in wardrobe and private bathroom, ensuring complete privacy.

This apartment stands out for its modern finishes and carefully selected materials:

- PVC windows with thermal double glazing;

- Electric shutters;

- White lacquered doors with magnetic locks;

- Floating flooring in the living areas and bedrooms;

- Ceramic flooring in the kitchen and bathrooms;

- Bathrooms with wall-mounted furniture and contemporary shower trays.

To make daily life even more convenient, the property includes:

- Air conditioning;

- Central vacuum system;

- Centralised shutter control;

- Video intercom;

- Electric vehicle charging point;

- Automatic gates.

Additionally, it comes with a parking space and storage, offering all the functionality you need.

Note: The materials and finishes shown are subject to final approval by the builder.

Pinhal do General is one of the most sought-after areas in Fernão Ferro, known for its family-friendly atmosphere, tranquillity, and excellent quality of life. Here, you'll find the perfect balance between the peace of a residential area and proximity to Lisbon, Setúbal, beaches, shops, schools, and services.

Book your visit today and come see what could be your next home.

SCI Properties will guide you through the entire purchase process and provide free mortgage assistance, thanks to a team of qualified professionals who work daily with leading banks to secure the best financing solutions.

